      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-28T19:23:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1) Previous rulings support your conclusion for #1.&nbsp; Redirecting damage is not an opportunity to boost it again.&nbsp; All you're doing is passing it along.</p><p>2) In the second case, you're not redirecting, you're producing a new instance of damage, so it would be boosted, I believe.</p>",
