      "raw": "<p>Redirection only changes the target.&nbsp; The source remains the same.&nbsp; Now, if the original source and the new target are nemeses, then you would add a nemesis bonus.&nbsp; If the old target and the new target are nemeses, it is irrelevant, as once the damage is redirected away from the old target, the old target no longer has any effect on the damage dealt.</p>",
